      "sourceTextSha256": "13965f1218466989b32767c12a20a4eeed19e4b5cb36d3ff45d9834a75ad346b",
      "text": "A jungle walk with a naturalist guide and a visit to a caboclo house, to discover local daily life and the secrets of making manioc flour. After lunch, a visit to the village of Acajatuba, where people live from fishing and farming and local artisans make crafts from natural seeds. Then a canoe trip into the igapó, the flooded forest, and piranha fishing; after dinner, a torch-lit walk along the riverbanks to spot caimans and, with luck, nightjars, snakes and frogs.\n\nMeeting of the Waters\n\nOptional, at an additional cost.\n\nPink river dolphins\n\nOptional, at an additional cost.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_aligned",
        "fileId": "1H7jAoR502x-m7S0TWHiol8udVN3eEtAp",
